  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.1-preview.33\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.33 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.32\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.32 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.31\n- Initial release: Windows App Check integration for `net10.0-windows10.0.19041.0`.\n- `UseWindows()` is a composition check for an existing core debug or custom provider. It provides no Windows attestation and registers no provider, because Windows desktop has no production Firebase App Check attestation provider.\n- Throws `WindowsFirebaseAppCheckException` with `AppCheckErrorCode.NoProvider` during composition when neither a core debug nor a custom provider is configured.",
